## Dev node — separate from production hecate@host
-sname hecate_dev

## Different cookie to avoid cluster conflicts
-setcookie hecate_dev_cookie

## No heartbeat in dev (don't auto-restart on crash)
## -heart

## Interactive code server — required for in-VM plugin loading
-mode interactive

-smp auto
+A 64
+P 1048576
+Q 65536
+sbt db
+SDio 32
